{"4884670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NOIRVANA", "steam_appid": 4884670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOIRVANA is a high-speed noir FPS where standing still is just a polite way to get shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide through gunfire, dive past bullets, wall-run, wall-jump, and grapple across brutal black-and-white combat arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only color is red. Try to make sure it is not yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884670/extras/4d607cd3c32fc71bb7e509a393a49722.poster.avif?t=1782940522\" width=1170 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884670/extras/4d607cd3c32fc71bb7e509a393a49722.webm?t=1782940522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884670/extras/4d607cd3c32fc71bb7e509a393a49722.mp4?t=1782940522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD MOMENTUM. BREAK EVERYTHING.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Chain kills to build score and speed.<br>• Restore health by staying aggressive.<br> • Let your overheal fade away, or keep killing and earn it back. <br>• No cover camping. No breathing room. No excuses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT FOR STYLE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blast your way through enemies with pistols, revolvers, shotguns, Tommy guns, thrown weapons, and whatever the last poor bastard dropped.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Land headshots. Slide-kill enemies. Blow up barrels. Make every room look like a noir crime scene. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land headshots. Slide-kill enemies. Blow up barrels. Make every room look like a noir crime scene.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884670/extras/fa33f94c937d10ae0a54b6c7ac7b2849.poster.avif?t=1782940522\" width=1170 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884670/extras/fa33f94c937d10ae0a54b6c7ac7b2849.webm?t=1782940522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884670/extras/fa33f94c937d10ae0a54b6c7ac7b2849.mp4?t=1782940522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>CHASE THE PERFECT RUN.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Clear compact score-attack arenas.<br> • Take on special challenges: Headshots Only, No Damage, Time Limits. <br>• Earn your grade. Climb the leaderboard. <br>• Fail spectacularly, rewind, and do it cleaner.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884670/extras/de232662ea6b9240f93c414a2bbf1628.poster.avif?t=1782940522\" width=1170 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884670/extras/de232662ea6b9240f93c414a2bbf1628.webm?t=1782940522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884670/extras/de232662ea6b9240f93c414a2bbf1628.mp4?t=1782940522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOIRVANA</strong> is about speed, style, and refusing to die quietly.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOIRVANA is a high-speed noir FPS where standing still is just a polite way to get shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide through gunfire, dive past bullets, wall-run, wall-jump, and grapple across brutal black-and-white combat arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only color is red